<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Brambles half year net rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Brambles half year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    187.4 vs 159.8</p>
<p>    Net				     117.2 vs 102.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     35.0 vs  34.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Brambles Industries Ltd is a transport, security and industrial services group.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.32 vs  1.51</p>
<p>    Other income			  131.2 vs  91.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    52.9 vs  46.6</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs loss 10.9</p>
<p>Dividend is 80 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 10</p>
<p>    Tax					67.6 vs  43.8</p>
<p>    Interest				 27.9 vs  36.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  159.2 vs 163.1</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
